WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.325
The Trifid, from the newest telescope.

00:02.996 --> 00:06.243
The Trifid Nebula, with the dark lanes that give it its name.

00:06.727 --> 00:13.942
This picture is among the very first from the Vera Rubin Observatory in Chile, released in June 2025.

00:14.552 --> 00:19.304
For ten years that telescope will photograph the southern sky every few nights.
